sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Bank as Bank
  participant Ph as Phone macro
  participant W as Webhook and parser
  participant A as Ask policy
  participant App as Web app and push
  actor U as You
  participant L as Ledger and learning
  Bank->>Ph: debit alert text
  Ph->>W: sender and text, secret header
  W->>W: drop OTPs, mandates and phone-number senders, keep no raw text
  W->>A: amount, direction, payee
  alt a known shop
    A-->>App: quiet tag with a Change button
  else a new shop, or a person
    A-->>App: card with three guesses
    App-->>U: tap one
    U->>L: answer, which adjusts how much each guess signal is trusted
  end
  Note over L: later the statement arrives and is reconciled with the ledger row, so nothing is counted twice
